OL,3,AIran says it is ready for what US calls
OL,4,A'greatest financial offensive ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has announced an "economic
OL,7,FD-Day" against Iran and threatened its
OL,8,Fsupporters but Tehran says it has a
OL,9,Ftwo-year plan to counter widened
OL,10,Fsanctions.
OL,12,FIn response to what US Treasury
OL,13,FSecretary Scott Bessent said was "the
OL,14,Fsingle greatest financial offensive
OL,15,Fever", Iran's economy minister Ali
OL,16,FMadanizadeh said it was "fully prepared
OL,17,Ffor the US sanctions", which would
OL,18,Fresult in another defeat for
OL,19,FWashington.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
