OL,3,AIran says it is ready for what US calls
OL,4,A'greatest financial offensive ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the latest threat to the Iranian
OL,7,Fregime, Bessent said the US would cut
OL,8,Fall economic ties with the country and
OL,9,Fadded that any nation financially
OL,10,Fpartnering with Iran would be isolated.
OL,12,FIt follows U-turns and extended
OL,13,Fdeadlines from the White House in its
OL,14,Fefforts to end the conflict.
